! Faithful port of the original pH-cell line (ZnMn02_v2.1_GITT_no_probe): the original program's run, defects included (docs/deviations.md),
! with illustrative inputs (the original runs' fitted values are not distributed). Fortran and C++ programs
! only (the Python package's faithful ports are in znmno2_model.faithful). Run from the repository root, or set
! data_dir to the folder of the spline tables.

&run
  mode = 'faithful_phcell'
  data_dir = 'python/znmno2_model/data'
/
&faithful
  rxnk_5 = -9.0, fraction_kmno2 = 0.7
/
&output
  file = 'faithful_phcell_out.txt'
/
